TEXT 962 646 Left 2 ;[w=456 h=217] **lin. Gleichungssystem:**   k = 25% = 0,25 \n ---------------------- \n1.  (V1+V2)/Rp = I1*(1-k) + I2*k \n    2,4mA = I1*0,75  + I2*0,25 \n2.   V2 = I2*Rp*k    - I3*(R1+R2) \n     12V = I2*2,5kOhm - I3*14.7kOhm \n3.   0  = I1       - I2         - I3 \n ------------------------------------------------------- \n**I1 = 2.31mA**\n**I2 = 2.67mA**  \n**I3 = 0.362mA**